18:36.500 --> 18:37.916
Tolong ajari kami.

18:39.166 --> 18:40.333
Ayo bersenang-senang. Bagus.

18:41.750 --> 18:44.708
Satu, dua, tiga.

18:45.916 --> 18:48.750
Dua, dua, tiga...

