31:08.041 --> 31:09.416
Ya, minum.

31:09.541 --> 31:10.541
Minum.

31:11.375 --> 31:12.208
Bocah konyol.

31:12.291 --> 31:13.291
Minumlah.

31:13.416 --> 31:16.125
Jangan keras kepala! Ayo, pegang dia.

31:16.458 --> 31:19.333
